End-to-end range-pipe shape mirroring libc++ views::take: a CRTP
__range_adaptor_closure base with a hidden friend template operator|
([temp.friend]/1), a take-closure created by aggregate initialization
with an empty-base element ([dcl.init.aggr]/2.2), and an array lvalue
binding the constrained forwarding reference ([temp.deduct.call]/2-3).
Exercises the round-123 friend-hoist and aggregate-base fixes
together.
